{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021071436998-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021115706\"/><p>事發在石硤尾邨美山樓一單位。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>今日(21日)早上6時28分，一名女子報案，指在石硤尾邨美山樓一單位內與丈夫發生爭執，期間遭「小三」襲擊。警員接報到場，證實女事主沒有受傷，經調查後列作「糾紛」案處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:36.223170+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:14:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:55.174229+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:08.763876+00:00","content_hash":"3d7fc1a63d85ef4fdbcf8f6dc868e3e9aff0ef2f11d99c3143671328dd508164","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}